    <name>Head of Product (m/f/x)</name>
    <jobDescriptions>
        <jobDescription>
            <name>Your mission</name>
            <value>
                <![CDATA[<p style="line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;"><span style="font-size:14px;font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;color:rgb(70,84,92);background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;">As Head of Product (m/f/x), you lead the Product organization at Bring! Labs, including Product Management, UX Research, UX Design and Customer Support. Reporting to the CTO and as part of the leadership team, you ensure our product strategy, organization and execution support the company's goals.</span></p><p style="line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;"><span style="font-size:14px;font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;color:rgb(70,84,92);background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;">This is first and foremost a </span><span style="font-size:14px;font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;color:rgb(70,84,92);background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;">leadership role</span><span style="font-size:14px;font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;color:rgb(70,84,92);background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;">. We are looking for an experienced people leader who creates clarity, drives accountability and develops high-performing teams. You will also play a key role in driving strategic, cross-functional initiatives and ensuring successful execution across teams.</span></p><h2 style="line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:18pt;margin-bottom:4pt;"><span style="font-size:14px;font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;color:rgb(70,84,92);background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;">What you'll do</span></h2><ul style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;"><li style="list-style-type:disc;font-size:14px;font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;color:rgb(70,84,92);background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;"><p style="line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;">Lead, coach and develop the Product organization (7 direct reports)</span></p></li><li style="list-style-type:disc;font-size:14px;font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;color:rgb(70,84,92);background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;"><p style="line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;">Translate company strategy into a clear, prioritized product roadmap together with your Product Managers</span></p></li><li style="list-style-type:disc;font-size:14px;font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;color:rgb(70,84,92);background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;"><p style="line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;">Define and track product success through clear goals, KPIs and data-driven decision making</span></p></li><li style="list-style-type:disc;font-size:14px;font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;color:rgb(70,84,92);background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;"><p style="line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;">Champion customer-centric thinking while balancing user needs with commercial objectives</span></p></li><li style="list-style-type:disc;font-size:14px;font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;color:rgb(70,84,92);background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;"><p style="line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;">Drive and coordinate strategic, cross-functional initiatives, ensuring alignment, momentum and successful delivery across multiple teams</span></p></li><li style="list-style-type:disc;font-size:14px;font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;color:rgb(70,84,92);background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;"><p style="line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;">Establish and continuously improve product development processes and standards</span></p></li><li style="list-style-type:disc;font-size:14px;font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;color:rgb(70,84,92);background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;"><p style="line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;">Resolve competing priorities across squads and collaborate closely with Engineering leadership </span></p></li><li style="list-style-type:disc;font-size:14px;font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;color:rgb(70,84,92);background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;"><p style="line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;">Own the Product department's organization, hiring, budget and long-term workforce planning</span></p></li><li style="list-style-type:disc;font-size:14px;font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;color:rgb(70,84,92);background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;"><p style="line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:12pt;"><span style="background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;">Drive a culture of ownership, accountability and high performance across the Product organization</span></p></li></ul>]]>
            </value>
        </jobDescription>
        <jobDescription>
            <name>Your profile</name>
            <value>
                <![CDATA[<ul style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;"><li style="list-style-type:disc;font-size:14px;font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;color:rgb(70,84,92);background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;"><p style="line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;">6+ years of Product Management experience, including 3+ years in a leadership role</span></p></li><li style="list-style-type:disc;font-size:14px;font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;color:rgb(70,84,92);background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;"><p style="line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;">Proven experience leading senior product professionals, driving organizational change and delivering complex cross-functional projects or strategic initiatives</span></p></li><li style="list-style-type:disc;font-size:14px;font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;color:rgb(70,84,92);background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;"><p style="line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;">Experience building and scaling software products or digital platforms</span></p></li><li style="list-style-type:disc;font-size:14px;font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;color:rgb(70,84,92);background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;"><p style="line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;">Strong leadership skills with the ability to set clear expectations, drive execution and make tough calls when expectations are not met</span></p></li><li style="list-style-type:disc;font-size:14px;font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;color:rgb(70,84,92);background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;"><p style="line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;">A strong commercial mindset with the ability to balance user needs, business goals and revenue opportunities, and to collaborate effectively with Sales and other commercial stakeholders </span></p></li><li style="list-style-type:disc;font-size:14px;font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;color:rgb(70,84,92);background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;"><p style="line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;">Experience translating business strategy into successful product execution</span></p></li><li style="list-style-type:disc;font-size:14px;font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;color:rgb(70,84,92);background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;"><p style="line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;">Excellent communication and stakeholder management skills </span></p></li><li style="list-style-type:disc;font-size:14px;font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;color:rgb(70,84,92);background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;"><p style="line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;">Solid understanding of modern product management practices and sufficient technical literacy to work effectively with Engineering</span></p></li><li style="list-style-type:disc;font-size:14px;font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;color:rgb(70,84,92);background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;"><p style="line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;">Business fluent in German and English<br></span></p></li></ul>]]>
            </value>
        </jobDescription>
        <jobDescription>
            <name>Why us?</name>
            <value>
                <![CDATA[<p><span style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:rgb(70,84,92);">We're a tech company with the vision of revolutionising the way brands and consumers communicate. At Bring! Labs, we value a professional, open and collaborative work environment where diverse perspectives and backgrounds are welcomed. We offer you a workplace where you can make a real impact while continuously growing your career.</span></p><p><span style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:rgb(70,84,92);">In addition, you can look forward to:</span></p><ul><li style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:rgb(70,84,92);">A modern and inspiring office in Zurich Binz, including free barista-quality coffee.</li><li style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:rgb(70,84,92);">The latest MacBook or HP laptop, along with a mouse, keyboard and premium headphones.</li><li style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:rgb(70,84,92);">26 days of annual leave – 25 vacation days plus an additional day off to celebrate your birthday.</li><li style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:rgb(70,84,92);">The flexibility of hybrid working: collaborate with your colleagues in the office or occasionally work from home.</li><li style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:rgb(70,84,92);">Environmentally friendly commuting support, including a Swiss Half Fare Travelcard (Halbtax).</li><li style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:rgb(70,84,92);">Regular social events: every six months, our entire company comes together in Zurich to connect, celebrate and have a great time.</li></ul><h2><span style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:rgb(70,84,92);">Ready to join us?</span></h2><p><span style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:rgb(70,84,92);">If this sounds like the right opportunity for you, we'd love to hear from you! Apply now and become part of our team. We’re looking forward to welcoming fresh perspectives, smart ideas and your contribution to Bring! Labs.</span></p><p><span style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:rgb(70,84,92);">Want to learn more? Visit our </span><span style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:rgb(70,84,92);"><a href="https://www.bringlabs.com/en/career" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">careers page</a></span><span style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:rgb(70,84,92);">!</span></p>]]>
            </value>
        </jobDescription>
